{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734714",
      "title": "Handling Form Submission",
      "sourceHash": "492bcea7f715e797934e2d844d52fe413df4a18102cf9a63846607baf16e2f42",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.01,
          "en": "So, how can we now handle form submission?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.01,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "And what should happen when the form is submitted?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 10.08,
          "en": "Well, in that case, I of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.08,
          "end": 11.67,
          "en": "also wanna close the model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.67,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "But I also wanna get the two values that were entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 19.98,
          "en": "and in the end add them to my list of posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.98,
          "end": 21.9,
          "en": "And the list of posts should then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.9,
          "end": 24.36,
          "en": "also be output dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.36,
          "end": 29.163,
          "en": "instead of having these two pseudo hard coded posts here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.75,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "So let's handle this step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 35.97,
          "en": "First of all, in the NewPost component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.97,
          "end": 39.09,
          "en": "on this form element, we should add an event listener,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 43.11,
          "en": "a new prop called onSubmit to listen to the default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.11,
          "end": 46.44,
          "en": "submit event, which is a default event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 49.71,
          "en": "supported by the browser out of the box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.71,
          "end": 52.38,
          "en": "Now we need a function that should be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.38,
          "end": 54.273,
          "en": "when that submit event occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.32,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "And I wanna have that function in the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 62.58,
          "en": "where I also collect the values that are entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.58,
          "end": 66.9,
          "en": "Now in my case here, these values are managed in PostsList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.9,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "but actually we don't need to do that there anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "I'll instead bring them back down to NewPost,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 76.56,
          "en": "to the NewPost component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 79.443,
          "en": "So I bring my state slices back there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 85.43,
          "en": "and therefore here we now import useState from React again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 88.8,
          "en": "And I don't need these state slices",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.8,
          "end": 90.24,
          "en": "in the parent component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.24,
          "end": 92.82,
          "en": "in the PostsList component anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 97.5,
          "en": "because I don't want to use them for setting my post author",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.5,
          "end": 99.21000000000001,
          "en": "and body here anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.21000000000001,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "Instead, I'll get rid of that post for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 103.8,
          "en": "and soon I wanna dynamically render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 105.87299999999999,
          "en": "a list of posts here anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.28,
          "end": 108.96000000000001,
          "en": "So therefore, we can also get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.96000000000001,
          "end": 113.25,
          "en": "and we must get rid of onBodyChange and onAuthorChange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.25,
          "end": 114.843,
          "en": "on the NewPost component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 118.11,
          "en": "And to clean things up, I'll also get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.11,
          "end": 120.57,
          "en": "of that code here and PostsList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.57,
          "end": 122.253,
          "en": "therefore is now much leaner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.3,
          "end": 125.37,
          "en": "But in the NewPost component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.37,
          "end": 129.6,
          "en": "I now wanna call bodyChangeHandler again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.6,
          "end": 132.12,
          "en": "if my text area changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.12,
          "end": 135.09,
          "en": "So I will set bodyChangeHandler as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.09,
          "end": 137.973,
          "en": "for the onChange prop here on text area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.02,
          "end": 141,
          "en": "And for input, onChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141,
          "end": 143.64,
          "en": "I'll set this to authorChangeHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.64,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "so that in the end these entered values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "are managed as state in the NewPost component again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 152.11,
          "en": "And these two props, onBodyChange and onAuthorChange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.27,
          "end": 154.923,
          "en": "are not needed here anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.39,
          "end": 159.6,
          "en": "Now we also must add a function that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.6,
          "end": 161.223,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.18,
          "end": 163.92000000000002,
          "en": "So I'll add a new function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.92000000000002,
          "end": 166.8,
          "en": "SubmitHandler could be the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.8,
          "end": 170.373,
          "en": "And this function is passed as a value to onSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.6,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "Now here, just as with the other event handler functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 177.09,
          "en": "we get an event object automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.09,
          "end": 178.59,
          "en": "since it's set to onSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.59,
          "end": 181.08,
          "en": "So to this default submit event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.08,
          "end": 183.69,
          "en": "And now we gotta do one important thing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.69,
          "end": 188.28,
          "en": "for this submit event because as I mentioned before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.28,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "when a form is submitted, this submit event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 195.27,
          "en": "will be triggered and the browser will automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.27,
          "end": 198.3,
          "en": "generate and send an HTTP request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.3,
          "end": 200.76,
          "en": "And we don't want that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.76,
          "end": 203.91,
          "en": "because sending an HTTP request to the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.91,
          "end": 206.57999999999998,
          "en": "that's serving this React app would in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.57999999999998,
          "end": 209.04,
          "en": "lead to the page being reloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.04,
          "end": 211.68,
          "en": "and we have no server site code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.68,
          "end": 214.11,
          "en": "that would handle that request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 218.25,
          "en": "React is a front end library running in the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.25,
          "end": 219.72,
          "en": "not on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.72,
          "end": 221.733,
          "en": "It can't handle that request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.84,
          "end": 225.15,
          "en": "Therefore, we have to use this event object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.15,
          "end": 228.84,
          "en": "and call the built-in preventDefault method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.84,
          "end": 229.983,
          "en": "written like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.82,
          "end": 233.34,
          "en": "This prevents the browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.34,
          "end": 236.883,
          "en": "of generating and sending an HTTP request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.78,
          "end": 242.1,
          "en": "With that done, we can then thereafter collect and group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.1,
          "end": 245.25,
          "en": "the entered body and entered author values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 245.25,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "into a postData object, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 253.17,
          "en": "A default JavaScript object where I add a body property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.17,
          "end": 255.23,
          "en": "which can be set to enteredBody",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.44,
          "end": 260.91,
          "en": "and an author property which can be set to enteredAuthor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.11,
          "end": 265.17,
          "en": "We could also add some client side validation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.17,
          "end": 267.99,
          "en": "and update some state to show an error or message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.99,
          "end": 270.21,
          "en": "if invalid data was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.21,
          "end": 273.72,
          "en": "but whilst that is something we do in the complete guide,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.72,
          "end": 276.6,
          "en": "it's not something we'll do here in this crash course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.6,
          "end": 280.62,
          "en": "Instead, we'll just assume that the provider's data is valid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 280.62,
          "end": 284.19,
          "en": "and we'll rely on the default browser validation added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 284.19,
          "end": 286.8,
          "en": "with help of the required attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.8,
          "end": 289.713,
          "en": "And we therefore now got our post data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.76,
          "end": 293.94,
          "en": "And now that post data in the end should be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 293.94,
          "end": 297.75,
          "en": "to a list of posts which should then actually be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 297.75,
          "end": 301.71,
          "en": "as a list of post components onto the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 301.71,
          "end": 303.33,
          "en": "And that's what we'll do next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.33,
          "end": 306.33,
          "en": "This is however, how we can handle form submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.33,
          "end": 308.25,
          "en": "and we can see that it works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 308.25,
          "end": 312.33,
          "en": "if we then console log our post data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.33,
          "end": 314.343,
          "en": "like this in the submitHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.66,
          "end": 318.66,
          "en": "If you save all your code and you make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.66,
          "end": 320.22,
          "en": "that the model is open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 320.22,
          "end": 322.8,
          "en": "and you open the developer tools thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 322.8,
          "end": 324.3,
          "en": "you can enter something there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.3,
          "end": 327.75,
          "en": "And as you click Submit, you get this object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.75,
          "end": 330.42,
          "en": "with those entered values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 330.42,
          "end": 331.68,
          "en": "So that's working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 331.68,
          "end": 334.5,
          "en": "And now I just wanna make sure that this model gets closed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 334.5,
          "end": 337.53,
          "en": "if I submit this, so therefore thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 337.53,
          "end": 342.53,
          "en": "I'll call onCancel as a function like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 343.71,
          "end": 347.79,
          "en": "Keep in mind onCancel is this prop which receives a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 347.79,
          "end": 350.82,
          "en": "as a value and therefore we can execute it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 350.82,
          "end": 354.18,
          "en": "as a function here hence executing that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 354.18,
          "end": 358.77,
          "en": "that is received as a value on the onCancel prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 358.77,
          "end": 361.2,
          "en": "And that function simply turns out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 361.2,
          "end": 363.96,
          "en": "to be that hideModalHandler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 363.96,
          "end": 368.13,
          "en": "So that's the function we're in the end executing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 368.13,
          "end": 370.83,
          "en": "So with that, if we try this again and click Submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 370.83,
          "end": 373.32,
          "en": "now the modal closes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 373.32,
          "end": 376.713,
          "en": "So let's now make sure we output that list of posts.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}